# Build context for docker/Dockerfile (roadmap §6.3; the context is the repository
# root, `docker build -f docker/Dockerfile .`): sources + submodule checkouts,
# no build trees, no git history (the commit is passed as LIGHTS3_GIT_COMMIT).
# Submodules must be checked out on the host first: ./build.sh does that, or
#   git submodule update --init third_party/{spdlog,httplib,json,rocksdb,hiredis,sqlite}
#   git submodule update --init --recursive third_party/ccmd
.git
**/.git
.claude
build
build-*
Testing
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
third_party/seastar
*.deb
*.rpm
*.tar.gz
